{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497090/extras/8d2522ebe05f51b3e2c86709a42d642e.avif?t=1758203766\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><strong></strong><br><strong>You are Yosihide Mizuno, a painter.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You have been using the drowned corpse of your younger sister, Misao \u2014 who took her own life at a young age \u2014 as the subject of your paintings.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But lately, you've begun to doubt your own memories.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Was that serene, beautiful face truly what you remember it to be?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With your solo exhibition fast approaching, desperation drives you to undergo a strange form of hypnotherapy, said to let you vividly recall your memories\u2014at the recommendation of a certain neurosurgeon.</strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0About</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kaeru Meisekimu Ghost in the Brain is a psychological horror game set in a world of madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your special abilities to survive terrifying encounters with monstrous, otherworldly beings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Keyhole Peeking<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497090/extras/289bb1076352a24c80d22e5665ac0035.avif?t=1758203766\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0A World of Mad Memories</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within your reconstructed memories lurk horrors beyond imagination:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >giant-eyed creatures, the ghost of a drowned girl,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a butterfly specimen with a girl\u2019s head, and even a flying arowana.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve twisted puzzles and gather fragments of memory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >while evading these abominations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape this lucid nightmare and reach the truth that lies beneath?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: This game is still in development. Content is subject to change without notice.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2497090?t=1758203766","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497090/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758203766","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497090/99740b57153bc723ece28e2d4f38a13defe8c32d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758203766","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497090/99740b57153bc723ece28e2d4f38a13defe8c32d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758203766","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497090/extras/8d2522ebe05f51b3e2c86709a42d642e.avif?t=1758203766\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><strong></strong><br><strong>You are Yosihide Mizuno, a painter.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You have been using the drowned corpse of your younger sister, Misao \u2014 who took her own life at a young age \u2014 as the subject of your paintings.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But lately, you've begun to doubt your own memories.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Was that serene, beautiful face truly what you remember it to be?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With your solo exhibition fast approaching, desperation drives you to undergo a strange form of hypnotherapy, said to let you vividly recall your memories\u2014at the recommendation of a certain neurosurgeon.</strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0About</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kaeru Meisekimu Ghost in the Brain is a psychological horror game set in a world of madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your special abilities to survive terrifying encounters with monstrous, otherworldly beings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Keyhole Peeking<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497090/extras/289bb1076352a24c80d22e5665ac0035.avif?t=1758203766\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0A World of Mad Memories</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within your reconstructed memories lurk horrors beyond imagination:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >giant-eyed creatures, the ghost of a drowned girl,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a butterfly specimen with a girl\u2019s head, and even a flying arowana.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve twisted puzzles and gather fragments of memory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >while evading these abominations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape this lucid nightmare and reach the truth that lies beneath?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: This game is still in development. Content is subject to change without notice.</p>","developers":["simizu games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497090/dae22ae120ede1e0aad0dd27c4a0b890ed7fd0f7/header.jpg?t=1758203766","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2497090/405212346/50a94bca94030df61f6dfd5c33d826308b56e927/1758199128/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758199639","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2497090/405212346/50a94bca94030df61f6dfd5c33d826308b56e927/1758199128/dash_h2